helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154792				0	ru	If sDate < sToday Then				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155601				0	ru	MsgBox "Срок годности истек"				20200411 15:09:53
