helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id312346798				0	ru	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Applies RLE (Run Length Encoding) to the BMP graphics.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
