helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id344441				0	ru	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Exports the file in binary format. The resulting file is smaller than a text file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
