helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id31456456938				0	ru	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to save the background of the picture as transparent. Only objects will be visible in the GIF image. Use the Color Replacer to set the transparent color in the picture.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id15				0	ru	For EPS files you can set the preview, the color format, the compression, and the version.				20200411 15:09:53
