helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010500.xhp	0	help	par_id3141111				0	ru	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Color Picker. First highlight a color in the Color table. Then click Edit to open the Color Picker. Select a color in the Color Picker and click OK. The selected color replaces the color that is highlighted in the Color table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
