helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	ru	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_CBX_USE_GRIDSNAP\"\>Specifies whether to move frames, drawing elements, and controls only between grid points.\</ahelp\> To change the status of the snap grip only for the current action, drag an object while holding down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Control key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
