helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	ru	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<variable id=\"rastertextdraw\"\>It is also possible to toggle the visibility of the grid with the \<emph\>Grid - Visible Grid\</emph\> command in the context menu for the page. You can also select the \<emph\>Grid - Grid to Front\</emph\> submenu of this context menu to display the grid in front of objects.\</variable\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
