helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778802				0	ru	Color Slider				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778802				0	ru	Click any of the six option buttons Red, Green, Blue, Hue, Saturation, or Brightness. The color slider changes to show the available range of values. \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorSlider\"\>In the color slider, you will see the range of values that you can change, depending on the selected option button. Click inside the color slider to change values in the big color field.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778803				0	ru	Current Color Preview				20200411 15:09:53
