helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	ru	To insert a scanned image, the driver for your scanner must be installed. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>Under UNIX systems, install the SANE package found at \<link href=\"http://www.sane-project.org/\"\>http://www.sane-project.org/\</link\>. The SANE package must use the same libc as $[officename].\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
