helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	ru	Automatically aligns objects to vertical and horizontal grid lines. To override this feature, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you drag an object.				20200411 15:09:53
