helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150721				0	ru	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389				0	ru	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</item\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3148414				0	ru	Select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Restart at the paragraph\</item\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
