helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	ru	Выберите команду \<emph\>Файл - Шаблоны - Сохранить\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	ru	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Template\</item\> box, type a name for the new template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	ru	Select a template category in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	ru	Нажмите кнопку \<emph\>ОК\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	ru	To create a document based on the template, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - New - Templates and Documents\</item\>, select the template, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
