helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149615				0	ru	To hide the borders of the frame, select the frame, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Frame/Object\</item\>. Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Borders\</item\> tab, and then click in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set No Border\</item\> box in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line Arrangement\</item\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
