helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	ru	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbers\</item\> box, select the numbering style that you want to use, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
